p><p>ダメよーダメダメ<img alt=\"不安\" class=\"emoji inline-block\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://stat100.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char4/597.png\" style=\"aspect-ratio: auto 24 / 24;\" width=\"24\"/><noscript><img alt=\"不安\" class=\"emoji inline-block\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://stat100.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char4/597.png\" width=\"24\"/></noscript>「こじべに」はダメ<img alt=\"悲しい\" class=\"emoji inline-block\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://stat100.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char4/596.png\" style=\"aspect-ratio: auto 24 / 24;\" width=\"24\"/><noscript><img alt=\"悲しい\" class=\"emoji inline-block\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://stat100.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char4/596.png\" width=\"24\"/></noscript>なぜダメかですって？</p><p>言わなくても分かるでしょ(｀･д･)σﾒｯ!</p>"
